WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Release-Group "Mania" presents
doramamania

00:00:25.560 --> 01:13:29.300
Mania

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:51.040
The room will be empty while the gentleman is in Sosnovy Bor

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.920
Clean up here

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.130
- Yes
- Yes

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:02.010
He left home and returned many times

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:05.050
Wait a couple of days, maybe he'll come back

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:07.140
This time it's different

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:10.850
He has changed

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:14.350
And maybe he'll get married soon

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:16.610
That's why we need to clean up everywhere

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.440
Is he engaged again?

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:23.700
If he doesn’t get married this time, he’s unlikely to get a wife again

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:25.860
This time everything is different!

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:30.830
The young master is deeply in love with someone

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:33.460
Really, Moo Deok?

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:37.750
The bird's egg he mentioned

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:42.800
I'm sure this is the girl I saw in Sosnovy Bor

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:46.260
Egg in a nest at the top of a tree

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:48.890
She's probably a sophisticated girl

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:51.270
which needs to be protected

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:54.060
Something like a white heron

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:55.190
Like me

00:01:55.270 --> 00:01:56.560
Who knows?

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:02.030
Hatches and turns out to be a bloodthirsty eagle,

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:04.190
and not a sophisticated heron

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:05.860
Yes?

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.240
Bloodthirsty eagle, what a horror

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:11.450
I hope the egg is not a woodpecker or a cuckoo

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:13.120
Don't worry

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:16.710
The chick will hatch and fly away

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:21.380
What if she loves him too?

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:27.340
If they are so close, I'm sure the feelings are mutual.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:30.390
The chick must be in love with him

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:35.390
I hope it's Ms. Ho

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:37.810
She looks like Mrs. Do Hwa too

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:41.980
- Eunuch Li
- Yes?

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:44.280
Put it there. These are Chan Wook's books

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:47.110
Hurry

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:53.160
What connects us with Chan Wook:

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:56.540
desperate desire to survive

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:02.460
and find yourself

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.010
When we get what we want,

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:18.020
we will immediately run away in different directions

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:23.070
The love that Maid Kim speaks of

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:27.740
maybe she slipped between us,

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:33.490
but it's nothing more than a shell that I'll throw away when I hatch

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:58.930
Have you already learned and written everything down?

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:02.810
Yes, you can check. I'm sure I remembered everything

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:06.900
Still,

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:09.240
this should have taken at least a month

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:13.030
I had 12 teachers, I read these books 12 times

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:14.740
You could say

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:17.200
the task was simpler

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.710
And I was wondering why he agreed to follow the rules

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.330
He had his reasons

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:25.710
Now I can leave Sosnovy Bor whenever I want. I'm home

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.500
Not so fast

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:37.060
Why?

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:40.270
The rules say I can go out if I master the basics

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:42.520
When I asked to read books,

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.650
I didn't mean to just remember them

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:46.650
You had to learn everything by heart

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.780
But since you are quite cunning,

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:53.160
I don’t believe that you memorized everything

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:56.160
I didn't know

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:59.750
that the head of Sosnovy Bor can change the rules as he pleases

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:02.040
Here

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.670
I have another task

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.500
If you read this book,

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:12.130
I will allow you to leave Sosnovy Bor whenever you want

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:16.970
No!

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.360
I'll definitely be able to go out

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.070
if I read it?

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.230
Exactly

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:33.860
I hope reading this book

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:37.200
it won't be difficult either

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.330
Everything is bad

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.750
Moo Deok won't be able to see Wook for a while

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.050
What? It's empty here

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:04.520
Not at all. There are words

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:06.770
No, there's nothing here

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.360
Do you see anything?

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.190
It's you who don't see anything

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:14.650
You can read this book only by concentrating your energy

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.240
This is Master Seo Kyung's book "Words of the Heart"

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:21.910
I see

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:25.710
So these are actually words?

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:28.500
Am I the only one who can't read them?

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:35.590
Your friend Chan Wook,

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.430
must have not known what kind of book it was

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:41.050
He never trained. How would he know?

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:43.020
He will be locked in the training hall until

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:44.560
until he reads it

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:46.440
I feel sorry for him

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:48.400
He was stuck there for six months

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:51.860
Six months is not long enough

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:55.400
He mastered Ryusu through luck, not training.

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:58.740
It will take him more than a year

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:10.460
How can we know you if we haven’t seen this book ourselves?

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:13.420
I'm sure you would need no less time

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.010
Also, he has moved further than you,

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:18.430
which, unlike him

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:20.640
I haven't held this book in my hands

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:28.520
He's right. Don't talk in vain

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.690
See you

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:32.520
Your...

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:40.070
Why did his uncle already give him this book?

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:42.950
I'm at a loss myself

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:46.790
He won't be able to do anything while he's stuck there.

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:54.710
I

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:57.670
I'm not going to teach Uka

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:01.640
I'll keep him close and keep an eye on him

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:04.550
This way he won't cause any more problems

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:09.560
So you didn’t take him under your wing, but just locked him in Sosnovy Bor?

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:13.650
Uk loudly entered Sosnovy Bor,

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:15.860
his father will arrive soon

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.030
Father? Chang Gang?

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:21.110
Chang Gang's greatest fear was that Wook would open the gate.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.330
and will go out into the world

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.290
As soon as Chang Gang finds out,

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.080
he'll be right back

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:34.500
Gwangju must go back and stop Jin Moo

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:37.670
Everything will be resolved

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:41.300
when will he return

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:45.010
I feel sorry for Chan Wook

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.760
He's come so far

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:50.100
no training at all

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:51.560
How will he read "Words of the Heart"?

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:52.890
It's impossible

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.860
Why does he also need to carry food?

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.740
I heard something about him here

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:09.120
There are strange rumors about the family, no skills,

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.500
- nasty character
- Not true

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:14.880
He's good

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:17.040
Where did you get the idea?

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.670
He's so harmful

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.970
that the only person who can handle him is Moo Deok

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:25.760
- Moo Deok?
- Yes

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:28.810
This is the maid who is always by his side

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:35.150
Moo Deok

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:38.480
Heard you were around all night

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:41.690
I thought it was Moo Deok. Sorry

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.950
That's why he thought I was Moo Deok

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.160
Hello

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:56.790
We are from Saejukwon

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:59.090
This way, madam

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.420
This is... fire...

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:06.700
Here

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:08.410
I have another task

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.080
He deceived me

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.120
Got me wrapped around my finger!

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:36.100
It's you again!

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:39.940
Yes. Are you going somewhere?

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:42.400
Well, yes. I need to meet someone

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:45.570
But why through the window?

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:49.200
This is an escape

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.990
Pretend you didn't see anything

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:01.790
Mrs. Huo is so impatient. Why didn't she wait for me?

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.210
Left without me

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:10.220
What is it?

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:13.390
Is Chan Wook not there?

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.560
No, he's there

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:17.520
Let's go upstairs then

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:21.310
I need to talk to him

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:23.100
Alone

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:28.780
It will take time. Wait outside

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:51.590
Mu Dok, the gentleman from Sosnovy Bor has arrived

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.180
looking for you

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:12.530
Hello Mr. Yul

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:16.830
Waiting for Uka?

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.830
He won't be around for a while

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:23.540
He was given a very difficult task

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:25.790
He can handle it

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.750
The main thing is to stay there

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:31.840
and continue studying

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:35.590
I've been worried about you since that day, but you look good

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:38.510
What did you do?

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:42.980
I'm a maid here, I worked, of course

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.980
Maid Kim is not here now

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.560
You can wait inside

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:49.900
I came to you, not to her

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:52.940
To me?

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:56.320
Why do you need to see me?

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.200
Well...

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:00.040
Umbrella

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:04.710
I came to pick up the umbrella you still have

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.460
Umbrella?

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:10.340
It tore due to the wind, I threw it away

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:12.710
How's that?

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.010
Then let's go

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:17.550
What?

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:19.220
For a new one

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:21.930
Buy me a new umbrella

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:27.350
Umbrellas

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:33.440
This one is exactly the same as yours

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:34.900
It's cheap...

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:39.120
One-time umbrella and cheap paper

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.370
Mine was made of expensive sheepskin and bamboo

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:44.370
Dear?

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:47.370
Why did you give the maid an expensive umbrella?

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:49.380
I lent it to you

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.630
Now it's time to give it back to me

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:56.590
This was my only umbrella

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:59.800
Why do you only have one umbrella?

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:02.010
I rarely walk in the rain

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:07.140
I broke my leg as a child
it still hurts when it rains

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:11.440
Does your sore leg still hurt?

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:18.610
Mister Park told me how you broke it

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.870
In Danhyangok

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:25.580
It's a pity that you are a magician with a weak leg

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:28.790
Probably healed badly

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:32.500
There was a friend

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:35.670
who was waiting for me in Danhyangok

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:40.470
She saved me and patched up the wound

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.970
Probably the leg didn’t heal because

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.100
that I didn't thank her

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:02.620
- I like this one
- What?

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.780
I'll take this one. Pay

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:08.160
Yes

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.500
- We'll take this one.
- Okay

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:17.050
Write it down in the name of Master Chang Gang

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:20.510
Why in his name? You should have paid

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:23.550
Where did the maid get the money?

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:24.890
You have them

00:16:25.390 --> 00:16:27.020
I saw it. Did you go

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:29.390
buy dresses with saved money

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:30.850
This is because...

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:38.570
- How much is it from me?
-You have good taste

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:41.110
This is our most expensive umbrella

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:47.540
That's it...

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.250
Moo Deok isn't there?

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.300
Why did she leave now?

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:00.880
Sir, have you been kicked out again?

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:03.970
No. I came for a short while

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:05.890
Back soon

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:06.800
I see

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.720
Moo Deok will be back soon

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:11.770
Do you want to take a swim first?

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.390
Exactly

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.900
It's been a long time since I splashed in the water at home

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:18.150
- I'll prepare everything
- Okay

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.380
They...

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:38.800
Were these honey cookies always this sweet?

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:43.380
Why isn’t there something like this in Sosnovy Bor?

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:46.090
The head also has a sweet tooth

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:07.200
Are we breaking up today?

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.530
Yes

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:13.160
Those three talkative sisters are about to finish their floriculture lesson.

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:14.460
and they will pass us by

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:17.330
If we argue in front of them,

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:20.040
they'll start a rumor that we broke up

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:27.510
As promised,

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:30.010
I will be the reason for our separation

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:33.060
First hit me in the face

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:35.940
Then push me away when I try to grab you and walk away

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:38.560
It's a little...

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:40.360
So it is necessary that

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.440
they believed that we had a quarrel and broke off the engagement

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:47.030
Then people will say bad things about you

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:50.620
And with a bad reputation, it will be difficult to find a suitable bride

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:54.700
I...

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.460
I don't want anyone looking for a mate for me

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:02.750
I'll marry the one

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:05.090
what I like

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:15.180
I won't hit you anyway

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:19.150
Better with this pain

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:22.650
Yes. It's possible that way

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:27.610
The tea is too hot

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:30.910
Your face will burn

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:37.710
Come on

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:39.790
Nothing

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:45.300
There will be a magic show soon

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.760
I really wanted to see

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:52.350
But I can't if we part today

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:55.220
But... ah... why?

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:59.140
I was still sitting at home, and this is almost a month,

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:02.400
after the dissolution of the engagement

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:06.190
I see

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:14.160
Then let's postpone the separation for a couple of days?

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:15.080
Yes?

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:21.290
But those three gossip girls will be there too

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:25.550
I don't think it's worth going there alone

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:30.220
Since they already think we're a couple, I'll go with you

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:34.800
Well, I think it's possible...

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:42.560
I want pumpkin and rice taffy

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.690
and also honey cookies

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:45.940
Of course

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:49.650
My master is like a child

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:51.860
He gets mischievous when there is nothing to eat

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:53.990
Tell him

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:59.290
I like these from pine pollen

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:02.000
I thought your preferences were expensive

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:04.460
- Should I give them?
- No

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:17.930
We hire servants in Sosnovy Bor

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:21.350
We hire servants in Sosnovy Bor

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:24.400
Requirements: healthy, literate, not convicted of crimes

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:28.940
I chalked it up to the Chan family

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:37.070
Give this to the owner

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:41.790
I still have work left. I'll go

00:21:58.890 --> 00:21:59.930
Here

00:22:00.010 --> 00:22:01.430
- Look around
- Yes

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:03.350
- Sorry
- Yes?

00:22:03.430 --> 00:22:04.600
Goodbye

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:11.860
Is this her?

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:13.110
She

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:16.110
Hey

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:18.370
- You stole my money
- Give me back my ring

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:24.870
- Mom...
- Where is she?

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:27.420
- Hey, stop!
- Hey!

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:28.670
Stop!

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:31.050
- Stop
- Fraudster!

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:33.510
- Thief!
- Come back!

00:22:33.590 --> 00:22:36.880
I'll catch you, you'll get it!

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:39.510
- Stop!
- Wait!

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:43.430
- Hurry!
- What are you doing?

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:44.640
Small...

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:46.350
Catch her!

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:48.560
- She escaped!
- That's right

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:50.480
- Is this her?
- Yes

00:22:57.820 --> 00:22:59.320
This is Moo Deok

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:00.240
Moo Dok!

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:07.330
Here you are...

00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:09.080
- Well...
- Catch her!

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:12.210
Come here! I'll arrange this for you!

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:13.550
Hey!

00:23:13.630 --> 00:23:14.800
Oh you...

00:23:27.060 --> 00:23:28.600
It was definitely her

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:32.230
But why can she see now?

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:48.210
She always blindfolded herself with this

00:23:50.330 --> 00:23:51.960
Wasn't it her?

00:24:11.770 --> 00:24:13.520
We met again

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:15.480
So I

00:24:16.070 --> 00:24:19.070
I came all the way here from the village of Sari because I heard you were here

00:24:19.150 --> 00:24:20.780
I've climbed far

00:24:21.410 --> 00:24:23.620
Did you think you would hide in the capital?

00:24:25.410 --> 00:24:26.330
What is this?

00:24:27.700 --> 00:24:31.290
Pretending to be blind?

00:24:33.580 --> 00:24:36.000
She pretended to be a poor thing,

00:24:36.090 --> 00:24:39.510
and then stole on the sly

00:24:41.970 --> 00:24:43.180
How are you

00:24:44.640 --> 00:24:46.430
dare to rob me?

00:24:48.520 --> 00:24:50.230
I don't know who...

00:24:51.980 --> 00:24:53.900
Your...

00:24:54.690 --> 00:24:58.030
You're trying to deceive me again

00:24:58.650 --> 00:24:59.530
Grab her

00:25:04.070 --> 00:25:05.280
Help!

00:25:05.370 --> 00:25:07.030
Please help!

00:25:09.370 --> 00:25:11.620
I'm blind!

00:25:11.710 --> 00:25:14.080
I don't know them

00:25:14.170 --> 00:25:16.540
they are trying to kidnap me

00:25:17.250 --> 00:25:20.880
Please help me!

00:25:20.970 --> 00:25:23.550
He's trying so hard, look

00:25:26.470 --> 00:25:27.430
Save!

00:25:27.510 --> 00:25:28.760
What were you staring at?

00:25:28.850 --> 00:25:31.270
- Come here
- Let go!

00:25:41.940 --> 00:25:44.490
You can't be dragged along against your will.

00:25:45.610 --> 00:25:48.280
I have my reasons

00:25:48.370 --> 00:25:49.830
so get out of the way

00:25:50.540 --> 00:25:52.370
I'm blind

00:25:52.460 --> 00:25:54.420
- and I don’t know them
- How did you...

00:25:57.040 --> 00:25:58.290
Catch him!

00:26:10.350 --> 00:26:12.100
He's a magician

00:26:12.180 --> 00:26:13.310
Let's run

00:26:21.610 --> 00:26:22.990
Can you stand up?

00:26:28.240 --> 00:26:29.780
Thank you

00:26:29.870 --> 00:26:31.620
They looked dangerous

00:26:31.700 --> 00:26:33.910
Ask the guards for help

00:26:34.660 --> 00:26:35.710
I'll take you to them

00:26:35.790 --> 00:26:38.580
No need. Everything is fine

00:26:40.290 --> 00:26:41.750
Your cane is broken

00:26:48.390 --> 00:26:49.350
This is an umbrella

00:26:50.390 --> 00:26:51.680
You can take it

00:27:08.610 --> 00:27:11.200
Mister, it's better to leave her

00:27:11.280 --> 00:27:13.830
And she didn’t want to go to the guards

00:27:13.910 --> 00:27:16.210
I don't know anything about her past

00:27:16.290 --> 00:27:18.040
but they were bandits

00:27:18.710 --> 00:27:22.880
It’s better not to meddle in their affairs, you’ll be safer

00:27:32.470 --> 00:27:33.640
I'll take you to them

00:27:34.520 --> 00:27:36.930
Ask the guards for help

00:27:41.190 --> 00:27:43.070
Maybe I should have agreed

00:28:04.130 --> 00:28:06.710
Number 125

00:28:08.220 --> 00:28:10.720
Have so many people signed up already?

00:28:10.800 --> 00:28:12.140
One hundred twenty five

00:28:13.220 --> 00:28:15.060
And they will only take five

00:28:16.270 --> 00:28:18.350
Is there hope?

00:28:18.930 --> 00:28:20.060
Hey Moo Deok

00:28:21.690 --> 00:28:22.900
Why are you here?

00:28:22.980 --> 00:28:24.440
Mister was looking for you

00:28:24.520 --> 00:28:26.980
Has Mr. Yul come again?

00:28:27.070 --> 00:28:29.150
Not him, Mr. Chan

00:28:29.900 --> 00:28:32.820
He ran away and came home

00:28:42.080 --> 00:28:45.630
I need to be back before sunset. Where does she wear it?

00:29:28.300 --> 00:29:29.420
Where is the owner?

00:29:29.510 --> 00:29:31.670
He just left, but I didn't see him either

00:29:34.220 --> 00:29:36.260
He said that he would follow the rules, why did he run away?

00:29:38.140 --> 00:29:39.930
I hope he doesn't get caught

00:29:42.940 --> 00:29:44.350
Just left

00:29:44.940 --> 00:29:45.940
Just now

00:29:47.860 --> 00:29:49.650
What's wrong with her?

00:30:14.130 --> 00:30:15.300
Chan Wook...

00:30:15.880 --> 00:30:16.800
Master!

00:30:21.560 --> 00:30:24.310
Where have you been? I thought we wouldn't see each other

00:30:53.380 --> 00:30:55.760
But we met. I'm glad

00:30:58.340 --> 00:31:00.800
I have to go. If they find out that I left, I'll get screwed

00:31:01.720 --> 00:31:04.350
Wait for me. I'll be there soon

00:31:06.020 --> 00:31:10.230
I found a way, so do what you have to do

00:31:10.310 --> 00:31:12.020
And I'll do what I have to do

00:31:13.440 --> 00:31:16.070
Okay. What kind of method?

00:31:17.450 --> 00:31:19.370
They are recruiting people

00:31:40.050 --> 00:31:41.260
Don't get caught. Have a nice trip

00:32:07.290 --> 00:32:10.500
Your Highness, why go to Saejukwon yourself?

00:32:10.580 --> 00:32:12.580
You should have called Master Ho to your place

00:32:14.090 --> 00:32:17.380
Stop it. It gives me a reason to go out and get some air.

00:32:17.460 --> 00:32:18.970
I like to walk

00:32:24.970 --> 00:32:26.060
It's Chan Wook

00:32:36.230 --> 00:32:37.860
Why are you here?

00:32:37.940 --> 00:32:40.030
I heard you're not allowed to leave study hall.

00:32:40.110 --> 00:32:41.820
until you read "Words of the Heart"

00:32:41.910 --> 00:32:44.320
First they came to Chwisonra for me,

00:32:44.410 --> 00:32:46.080
now follow me

00:32:46.790 --> 00:32:49.960
Where does this interest in me come from? It's scary

00:32:50.040 --> 00:32:52.040
Master Ho told me

00:32:53.000 --> 00:32:56.630
I heard you weren't able to stand on your feet after the drink I gave you.

00:32:56.710 --> 00:32:59.010
Why did you come to Sejukwon?

00:32:59.720 --> 00:33:04.220
Do the wounds from my blows still hurt?

00:33:04.300 --> 00:33:05.390
Poor...

00:33:05.470 --> 00:33:08.560
They don't hurt. I'm healthy

00:33:08.640 --> 00:33:11.100
I came to take some useful drugs

00:33:11.890 --> 00:33:15.360
I hope you took a lot of things. You should live a long and healthy life

00:33:17.400 --> 00:33:20.110
What were you hiding?

00:33:21.200 --> 00:33:22.200
Show me

00:33:39.840 --> 00:33:40.880
Honey cookies

00:33:41.470 --> 00:33:44.130
I wanted to eat it myself. How did you know?

00:33:44.720 --> 00:33:45.840
Take

00:33:52.180 --> 00:33:55.270
There are no such sweets in Sosnovy Bor

00:33:56.730 --> 00:33:57.860
Did you go home?

00:34:04.780 --> 00:34:07.910
You'll get in trouble if they find out you ran away

00:34:08.530 --> 00:34:11.790
You brought me a drink and gave me a compliment

00:34:11.870 --> 00:34:14.830
Will you really tell me about my little crime?

00:34:18.460 --> 00:34:20.880
I... gave you honey cookies

00:34:26.220 --> 00:34:30.600
Go around that big pine tree. There were many magicians there

00:34:33.560 --> 00:34:35.690
Thank you, Your Highness. Goodbye

00:34:39.980 --> 00:34:42.070
I don’t understand why I’m so nice to him

00:34:46.570 --> 00:34:48.120
Delicious

00:34:48.910 --> 00:34:50.080
Yes?

00:34:54.080 --> 00:34:55.870
- Is it delicious, Your Highness?
- Yes

00:34:56.460 --> 00:34:58.420
I thought the Crown Prince

00:34:59.290 --> 00:35:02.000
will be hostile to magicians

00:35:03.170 --> 00:35:05.090
And he sheathed the sword

00:35:05.760 --> 00:35:07.930
and became closer to them

00:35:08.550 --> 00:35:11.810
Perhaps he decided to make them his friends to use,

00:35:11.890 --> 00:35:13.520
when will he be the next king

00:35:15.230 --> 00:35:18.600
Are you sure you shouldn't do anything?

00:35:18.690 --> 00:35:19.940
Don't worry

00:35:20.020 --> 00:35:21.980
It won't be hard to change his opinion.

00:35:22.610 --> 00:35:24.940
We have a sign with the constellation of Chang Wook

00:35:26.740 --> 00:35:30.200
The Crown Prince will have no choice but to kill him.

00:35:41.170 --> 00:35:45.760
Are we using this to subdue Jin Ho Kyung?

00:35:45.840 --> 00:35:49.180
Jinyeowon will soon be ours

00:36:09.820 --> 00:36:12.410
Four hours have passed since the mistress came in

00:36:15.120 --> 00:36:16.370
Don't interfere

00:36:16.450 --> 00:36:17.790
Apparently they had a lot to discuss

00:36:21.500 --> 00:36:24.290
Hey, stop!

00:36:25.300 --> 00:36:27.550
She asked me not to disturb them!

00:36:27.630 --> 00:36:28.800
Something's wrong

00:36:28.880 --> 00:36:31.090
I have to check if Chan Wook is there or not

00:36:31.180 --> 00:36:33.390
Do you think my lady is lying?

00:36:38.980 --> 00:36:41.020
Why hasn't he returned yet?

00:36:42.730 --> 00:36:46.150
It will be strange if they find out that he is not here

00:36:56.280 --> 00:36:58.160
What are you doing here?

00:36:59.120 --> 00:37:03.290
I said that we will be together so that you don't get caught

00:37:04.330 --> 00:37:06.210
I've been waiting for your return

00:37:12.760 --> 00:37:15.760
Do you see? They are together

00:37:17.810 --> 00:37:19.140
I'll go

00:37:19.640 --> 00:37:22.730
It was nice talking to you

00:37:24.100 --> 00:37:25.310
Yes, mutually

00:37:25.900 --> 00:37:27.190
Goodbye

00:37:37.700 --> 00:37:39.950
What did you do during those four hours?

00:37:41.370 --> 00:37:42.580
Indeed

00:37:43.370 --> 00:37:46.790
What were we doing?

00:38:09.270 --> 00:38:10.730
She was bored

00:38:15.160 --> 00:38:17.620
Do you want to become a maid in Sosnovy Bor?

00:38:18.200 --> 00:38:20.240
Yes. You know what happened today

00:38:20.330 --> 00:38:24.620
The owner needs me nearby

00:38:25.460 --> 00:38:26.420
I agree

00:38:27.170 --> 00:38:30.800
Apparently, he was very uncomfortable there that he came home to wash and eat

00:38:31.630 --> 00:38:34.930
Our gentleman is very gentle. Everyone was running around him when he was growing up.

00:38:35.010 --> 00:38:37.220
Living with others in Sosnovy Bor is not suitable for him

00:38:37.800 --> 00:38:39.050
One hundred twenty five

00:38:39.140 --> 00:38:40.350
I've already signed up

00:38:41.260 --> 00:38:42.390
I'll definitely get there

00:38:43.390 --> 00:38:45.310
Yes, yes, but this is not necessary

00:38:45.980 --> 00:38:47.480
We are servants of the Chan family

00:38:47.560 --> 00:38:49.020
We can easily get there

00:38:49.650 --> 00:38:50.570
Really?

00:38:50.650 --> 00:38:53.650
I don't need to take the exam?

00:38:53.740 --> 00:38:56.280
Certainly. Trust me

00:38:59.490 --> 00:39:00.950
No way

00:39:01.620 --> 00:39:05.460
Servants in Sosnovy Bor are hired only through open selection

00:39:05.540 --> 00:39:06.790
No exceptions

00:39:06.870 --> 00:39:09.040
I'm not asking you to give her a place for nothing

00:39:09.130 --> 00:39:11.880
She just needs an amulet. Write her name

00:39:11.960 --> 00:39:13.550
Then she'll get it

00:39:13.630 --> 00:39:15.380
We will pay every month

00:39:18.930 --> 00:39:20.180
And...

00:39:20.850 --> 00:39:21.890
Here

00:39:23.350 --> 00:39:26.560
I thought it would suit you, so I took it with me, maid Pak

00:39:57.590 --> 00:40:01.470
They say you tried

00:40:01.550 --> 00:40:05.430
bribe the maid Pak with this

00:40:06.060 --> 00:40:09.140
- It's just a gift...
- You asked her

00:40:10.060 --> 00:40:12.400
give Moo Deok a place here

00:40:12.480 --> 00:40:15.530
Our master is very sensitive,

00:40:15.610 --> 00:40:17.570
so I thought if Moo Deok

00:40:17.650 --> 00:40:21.620
will be with him, it will be easier for the master, so I asked for a favor

00:40:23.160 --> 00:40:24.370
So this is bribery indeed!

00:40:25.740 --> 00:40:29.040
I'm sorry. I didn't think

00:40:29.120 --> 00:40:31.170
When Pak's maid brought this to me,

00:40:31.250 --> 00:40:34.090
I told her you would never do that

00:40:34.880 --> 00:40:36.000
I was sure

00:40:36.090 --> 00:40:40.090
How can I look her in the eyes now?

00:40:40.180 --> 00:40:41.430
I...

00:40:45.720 --> 00:40:48.180
I'll apologize to her

00:40:48.810 --> 00:40:50.020
What will people think?

00:40:50.850 --> 00:40:54.310
They'll think you took advantage of our relationship

00:40:54.400 --> 00:40:56.270
to give someone a bribe

00:40:56.360 --> 00:40:59.820
I gave her a scarf, but I didn't mention you

00:40:59.900 --> 00:41:01.070
Even so,

00:41:01.150 --> 00:41:03.780
everyone in Sosnovy Bor knows that we are close

00:41:03.870 --> 00:41:07.540
If you do this, I won't be able to...

00:41:10.910 --> 00:41:14.960
maintain our close relationships

00:41:16.800 --> 00:41:20.510
Then... I won't come here again

00:41:21.680 --> 00:41:22.880
So what?

00:41:22.970 --> 00:41:26.600
Were you and I that close?

00:41:27.220 --> 00:41:29.020
If it were like that, you wouldn't be able to

00:41:29.100 --> 00:41:32.140
It's so easy to talk about breaking up

00:41:32.230 --> 00:41:33.560
Okay

00:41:34.270 --> 00:41:37.610
- Maid Kim, I...
- I'll tell the maid Pak,

00:41:37.690 --> 00:41:40.110
that I, who dared to give a bribe,

00:41:40.190 --> 00:41:41.610
quite

00:41:41.700 --> 00:41:44.820
not close with the head of Sosnovy Bor

00:41:44.910 --> 00:41:46.200
- This...
- Yes

00:41:46.780 --> 00:41:48.790
I'm very sorry that because of me

00:41:48.870 --> 00:41:50.250
you lost face

00:41:51.120 --> 00:41:52.620
Maid Kim

00:41:54.370 --> 00:41:56.290
You can't just walk away

00:42:03.170 --> 00:42:04.380
Take it away

00:42:06.340 --> 00:42:09.850
If I keep it, it will mean that I accepted a bribe

00:42:26.820 --> 00:42:28.530
And...

00:42:29.780 --> 00:42:31.790
I didn't mean

00:42:33.460 --> 00:42:36.620
that I don't want to see you...

00:42:36.710 --> 00:42:37.790
Serve...

00:42:37.880 --> 00:42:39.540
Maid Kim!

00:42:44.880 --> 00:42:46.090
How complicated it is

00:43:03.990 --> 00:43:05.490
You won't read

00:43:08.240 --> 00:43:09.370
Master Li

00:43:10.030 --> 00:43:12.950
With your current concentration, you won't be able to read

00:43:13.620 --> 00:43:16.790
You never trained hard like the others

00:43:16.870 --> 00:43:19.880
How long will it take if I start training now?

00:43:19.960 --> 00:43:22.380
Fastest - a year

00:43:23.420 --> 00:43:26.630
Doesn't fit. I refuse to sit here for a whole year

00:43:26.720 --> 00:43:29.840
I think that's why Park Jin gave you this book

00:43:34.390 --> 00:43:35.850
You will shorten the time

00:43:36.600 --> 00:43:40.360
if you become my student and follow my teachings

00:43:40.440 --> 00:43:41.610
That is...

00:43:42.980 --> 00:43:44.690
drink that tea?

00:43:47.950 --> 00:43:50.280
Give me time to think

00:43:51.700 --> 00:43:54.120
This is my teacher's book

00:43:54.200 --> 00:43:58.540
Here is a poem by Master Seo Kyung

00:43:58.620 --> 00:43:59.790
Verse?

00:43:59.870 --> 00:44:01.880
It's not that long

00:44:02.880 --> 00:44:05.460
Read the first word

00:44:05.550 --> 00:44:07.510
the rest will work itself out

00:44:08.970 --> 00:44:11.720
Exactly. You can't read it yet

00:44:12.680 --> 00:44:15.720
Is it fun to mock me? You won't tell me what's there

00:44:15.810 --> 00:44:17.100
Fun to watch

00:44:19.100 --> 00:44:21.600
Shall I help you this time?

00:44:23.480 --> 00:44:24.320
Yes

00:44:25.230 --> 00:44:28.610
I'll tell you an unknown secret

00:44:29.900 --> 00:44:33.490
It's actually a love letter

00:44:35.080 --> 00:44:36.450
Love letter?

00:44:36.540 --> 00:44:37.580
Yes

00:44:37.660 --> 00:44:41.580
Hundreds of magicians have read this book, but no one knows it

00:44:45.500 --> 00:44:49.550
Master So Kyung wrote this book to the one who could not see,

00:44:49.630 --> 00:44:52.470
so that she reads it with her heart and heart

00:44:57.100 --> 00:45:00.310
You can read a book by concentrating your energy

00:45:00.390 --> 00:45:04.400
Think about how else this is possible, knowing that this is a love letter.

00:45:05.980 --> 00:45:09.690
How does a love letter begin?

00:45:16.950 --> 00:45:18.120
What's there?

00:45:21.120 --> 00:45:22.370
Is he a pervert?

00:45:22.460 --> 00:45:26.040
Why let someone read your love letter?

00:45:26.540 --> 00:45:29.260
Why should I read this? I still don't see anything

00:45:30.090 --> 00:45:31.630
Was he really a pervert?

00:45:34.590 --> 00:45:39.020
Master Li, it's already getting cold. Why do you need to return to Danhyangok?

00:45:39.100 --> 00:45:42.230
Stay here. I'll take care of you

00:45:42.980 --> 00:45:44.020
Yeom

00:45:44.100 --> 00:45:48.820
Warm clothes and comfortable housing will not help you train

00:45:48.900 --> 00:45:53.070
I just want my teacher to live warm

00:45:56.660 --> 00:45:59.540
Have you grown up?

00:46:17.600 --> 00:46:20.140
This is maid Kim from the Chan house

00:46:20.720 --> 00:46:23.730
She looks sad, apparently she had a fight with Jin again

00:46:25.230 --> 00:46:27.110
Oh, masters!

00:46:31.650 --> 00:46:32.900
Master Li,

00:46:33.740 --> 00:46:36.160
why did you leave so quickly that time?

00:46:36.240 --> 00:46:37.950
I couldn't thank you

00:46:38.030 --> 00:46:41.240
Have you met before?

00:46:41.870 --> 00:46:44.580
At a holiday in Chwiseonru

00:46:45.670 --> 00:46:47.170
How are your clothes?

00:46:47.250 --> 00:46:49.460
She's separated

00:46:50.750 --> 00:46:51.960
It's okay

00:46:52.460 --> 00:46:53.720
Divorced?

00:46:53.800 --> 00:46:55.090
I see

00:46:55.680 --> 00:46:56.800
It's cold

00:46:56.880 --> 00:46:58.760
Aren't you freezing in this?

00:47:00.260 --> 00:47:02.060
Take a scarf

00:47:02.140 --> 00:47:04.520
I wanted to thank you somehow

00:47:07.600 --> 00:47:10.690
This is a gift, not a bribe

00:47:11.270 --> 00:47:12.400
Here

00:47:31.840 --> 00:47:33.460
Suits you

00:47:43.720 --> 00:47:46.520
Are you comfortable in a scarf?

00:47:55.110 --> 00:47:59.280
Competition for the selection of servants in Sosnovy Bor

00:48:02.450 --> 00:48:03.490
Now

00:48:04.240 --> 00:48:06.750
we will begin the selection of servants

00:48:06.830 --> 00:48:10.750
Those who pass will end up in Sosnovy Bor

00:48:11.330 --> 00:48:13.590
I'll go through the list

00:48:14.300 --> 00:48:16.550
Answer when I call your name

00:48:19.430 --> 00:48:21.510
Number 1: Park Joon Hwa

00:48:22.100 --> 00:48:22.970
Here

00:48:23.050 --> 00:48:24.970
Number two: Ahn So-jeong

00:48:25.060 --> 00:48:26.140
Here

00:48:27.930 --> 00:48:29.020
Ahn So Jeong...

00:48:29.100 --> 00:48:30.350
Two

00:48:30.440 --> 00:48:31.440
An...

00:48:33.110 --> 00:48:35.440
- Three: Lee Young Ok
- Here

00:48:35.530 --> 00:48:37.400
- Four: Park Hyun Soo
- Here

00:48:38.400 --> 00:48:40.700
- Five: Bae Hwi Young
- Here

00:48:48.080 --> 00:48:49.160
What is this?

00:48:49.250 --> 00:48:50.750
I want to make sure

00:48:54.540 --> 00:48:56.880
125: Moo Deok

00:48:58.630 --> 00:48:59.880
And here she is

00:48:59.970 --> 00:49:02.840
Number 125: Moo Deok

00:49:04.260 --> 00:49:05.300
Here!

00:49:10.480 --> 00:49:14.400
Your maid, Moo Dok, is in Sosnovy Bor today

00:49:15.610 --> 00:49:17.360
I'm warning you

00:49:17.440 --> 00:49:18.940
Don't even think about leaving this room

00:49:19.030 --> 00:49:20.400
Is it possible with me...

00:49:23.280 --> 00:49:24.820
Can you not make noise?

00:49:24.910 --> 00:49:27.370
I'm trying to concentrate to read

00:49:27.450 --> 00:49:28.870
I won't interfere

00:49:42.380 --> 00:49:46.140
In three days I'm waiting for you, Your Highness

00:49:46.220 --> 00:49:50.060
Why is Sosnovy Bor so crowded today?

00:49:50.890 --> 00:49:55.150
Today they are holding a competition to hire new servants

00:49:55.810 --> 00:49:58.610
- Is it necessary to organize a whole competition?
- Your Highness

00:49:59.190 --> 00:50:01.490
There are a lot of people who want to work here

00:50:01.570 --> 00:50:04.700
The Chan family's maid was also here

00:50:06.070 --> 00:50:08.160
- Won Moo Deok?
- Yes

00:50:21.460 --> 00:50:23.090
The first task will be appreciated

00:50:23.670 --> 00:50:28.220
your ability to read and count

00:50:29.010 --> 00:50:30.720
We need to get everything right

00:50:30.810 --> 00:50:33.480
One wrong answer and you're out immediately.

00:50:41.730 --> 00:50:43.740
Yul!

00:50:46.070 --> 00:50:47.410
This is an assignment from a competition

00:50:49.330 --> 00:50:51.830
Lots of questions. Even with a short answer

00:50:52.450 --> 00:50:53.960
Moo Deok is smart

00:50:54.040 --> 00:50:55.540
Will she be able to handle it?

00:50:58.750 --> 00:51:00.130
It's complicated

00:51:00.210 --> 00:51:03.010
Eunuch Oh, how can you remove ink from clothes?

00:51:03.090 --> 00:51:04.220
Here's a question

00:51:04.300 --> 00:51:06.680
Rice paste is just right

00:51:07.300 --> 00:51:08.550
And what should you do with it?

00:51:08.640 --> 00:51:11.470
First you need a little on the stain...

00:51:17.690 --> 00:51:20.690
"You invited 20 people from 3 different families"

00:51:20.770 --> 00:51:24.150
“Four people can sit at one table, how many tables do you need?”

00:51:26.110 --> 00:51:29.570
20 from each family - that's 60 in total

00:51:31.660 --> 00:51:35.290
Once there are four at one table,

00:51:36.160 --> 00:51:37.420
- need 15
- No

00:51:38.330 --> 00:51:40.380
Three families are specifically mentioned

00:51:41.290 --> 00:51:45.340
Representatives of the same family must sit at the same table

00:51:46.050 --> 00:51:48.380
Then we need more tables

00:51:48.470 --> 00:51:50.760
9 tables for each family

00:51:52.220 --> 00:51:53.600
Then a total of 27 tables

00:52:00.020 --> 00:52:01.480
This is an invitation

00:52:01.560 --> 00:52:03.110
9 x 3 = 27

00:52:03.190 --> 00:52:05.860
The host will also need a table

00:52:06.610 --> 00:52:08.150
27 + host = 2...

00:52:08.240 --> 00:52:09.740
28 total

00:52:12.160 --> 00:52:14.330
You're right

00:52:14.950 --> 00:52:16.950
28

00:52:17.460 --> 00:52:20.210
Next is the question of how to complete the assignment and not get lost

00:52:21.000 --> 00:52:23.380
I'll get a map of the capital

00:52:24.630 --> 00:52:26.800
How can you remove ink from clothes?

00:52:27.470 --> 00:52:29.760
What to do if ink is spilled on your clothes?

00:52:29.840 --> 00:52:32.470
Can't you throw it away? Eunuch O

00:52:33.390 --> 00:52:34.640
Yes, Your Highness

00:52:34.720 --> 00:52:37.730
How to remove ink from clothes?

00:52:37.810 --> 00:52:39.890
Take some warm rice paste

00:52:39.980 --> 00:52:41.850
- and smear...
- Exactly

00:52:42.980 --> 00:52:44.190
Write

00:52:44.980 --> 00:52:46.820
"Warm rice paste"

00:52:51.570 --> 00:52:53.280
Everything is exactly right

00:52:53.370 --> 00:52:55.490
I didn't think I'd do something like this with you, but it was fun

00:52:56.120 --> 00:52:58.450
Moo Deok can't handle it on her own

00:53:02.580 --> 00:53:07.250
Therefore, we must somehow convey this paper to her.

00:53:08.760 --> 00:53:12.260
How? It will be too obvious

00:53:13.260 --> 00:53:17.560
Perhaps someone very noticeable will escape suspicion

00:53:37.450 --> 00:53:38.660
Difficult

00:53:39.290 --> 00:53:41.040
More difficult than I thought

00:53:43.080 --> 00:53:45.170
Don't peek!

00:53:48.250 --> 00:53:51.670
The Crown Prince has arrived! Say hello to him!

00:53:55.090 --> 00:53:56.600
Your Highness!

00:53:56.680 --> 00:53:59.720
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

00:54:05.770 --> 00:54:09.110
I heard there is an important competition here, so I came to support you

00:54:11.150 --> 00:54:12.700
It's an honor for us

00:54:12.780 --> 00:54:15.870
Don't mind me, do the task

00:54:33.880 --> 00:54:34.800
We're working!

00:54:36.260 --> 00:54:37.600
Decide!

00:54:38.180 --> 00:54:39.390
Decide

00:54:39.470 --> 00:54:40.810
- You too
- Decide...

00:54:41.350 --> 00:54:42.520
Get back to work

00:55:24.430 --> 00:55:28.650
Now I will announce those who passed

00:55:31.360 --> 00:55:34.320
Park Jung Hwa. Passed

00:55:35.030 --> 00:55:37.320
Lee Young Ok failed

00:55:37.400 --> 00:55:40.490
Hwang Young Ji failed

00:55:41.330 --> 00:55:43.370
Oh Jae Ho passed

00:55:45.870 --> 00:55:47.540
Number 125

00:55:47.620 --> 00:55:48.960
Moo Deok

00:55:58.930 --> 00:56:00.340
Your Highness!

00:56:02.680 --> 00:56:04.140
She passed!

00:56:04.220 --> 00:56:05.770
Yes!

00:56:10.020 --> 00:56:11.270
Excellent

00:56:12.060 --> 00:56:16.190
40 people completed the first task

00:56:16.280 --> 00:56:19.820
And then the practical task

00:56:22.320 --> 00:56:26.700
This task will evaluate their skills.

00:56:27.580 --> 00:56:28.910
Prepare to eat,

00:56:29.000 --> 00:56:31.830
clean up, wash things

00:56:31.920 --> 00:56:34.380
And then they will also test your endurance

00:57:03.700 --> 00:57:06.330
Room 125, Moo Deok

00:57:06.410 --> 00:57:07.830
Gone!

00:57:36.860 --> 00:57:38.940
Room 125, Moo Deok

00:57:39.030 --> 00:57:39.940
Gone!

00:57:42.990 --> 00:57:44.160
One hundred twenty five

00:57:54.880 --> 00:57:56.840
Room 125, Moo Deok

00:57:57.340 --> 00:57:58.670
Gone!

00:58:01.970 --> 00:58:04.510
Moo Deok is amazing

00:58:04.590 --> 00:58:06.390
Last task left

00:58:06.470 --> 00:58:08.390
We need to go and support her

00:58:09.140 --> 00:58:12.060
There were a lot of good guys there

00:58:12.140 --> 00:58:14.400
I doubt that she will be among those who passed

00:58:14.480 --> 00:58:16.730
Your Highness, thank you for your help

00:58:17.310 --> 00:58:18.270
For this

00:58:20.570 --> 00:58:22.700
- Let's go
- Yes

00:58:25.240 --> 00:58:29.160
Is that what he told me not to come?

00:58:29.240 --> 00:58:31.660
Why be so angry?

00:58:31.750 --> 00:58:33.870
I can't believe it

00:58:34.790 --> 00:58:36.380
It doesn't matter. Let's go

00:58:37.170 --> 00:58:38.460
Your Highness, let's go there

00:58:41.460 --> 00:58:43.470
- I know
- Yes, Your Highness

00:58:44.470 --> 00:58:48.890
You have to walk five times and come back with water*

00:58:44.470 --> 00:58:48.890
*approximately 20 km

00:58:48.970 --> 00:58:50.430
Top five

00:58:51.100 --> 00:58:54.390
will win the competition

00:58:55.640 --> 00:58:56.900
The last obstacle

00:58:58.110 --> 00:59:00.110
I should be among the first

00:59:12.290 --> 00:59:13.120
Go ahead!

00:59:21.710 --> 00:59:24.840
He spends days poring over "Words of the Heart"

00:59:26.590 --> 00:59:27.720
Yes?

00:59:35.980 --> 00:59:37.980
You can't read it that quickly

00:59:38.060 --> 00:59:39.520
Be patient

00:59:41.730 --> 00:59:43.030
Yes

00:59:43.730 --> 00:59:47.030
Maid Kim is very worried about you

00:59:47.910 --> 00:59:49.700
Let me know if you need anything

00:59:49.780 --> 00:59:53.950
I will order the bed, food and clothes you want to be prepared.

00:59:55.790 --> 00:59:57.210
Not worth it

01:00:06.380 --> 01:00:08.720
The wind is colder

01:00:08.800 --> 01:00:11.220
Close the windows

01:00:12.760 --> 01:00:16.930
Master So Kyung wrote this book to the one who could not see,

01:00:17.020 --> 01:00:19.980
so she can read it with her heart

01:00:21.610 --> 01:00:23.230
I have a question

01:00:24.320 --> 01:00:28.200
Master So Kyung knew the blind woman?

01:00:32.070 --> 01:00:34.450
During the great chaos of two hundred years ago

01:00:35.120 --> 01:00:37.370
was next to the master

01:00:37.450 --> 01:00:39.830
Jinyeowon's first chapter

01:00:39.920 --> 01:00:42.880
And she was blind

01:00:44.090 --> 01:00:47.840
He wrote this message to the head of Jinyeowon

01:00:49.720 --> 01:00:53.800
Is this really something everyone can read?

01:00:54.470 --> 01:00:56.600
And if his feelings are described here,

01:00:56.680 --> 01:00:58.770
which you put on public display?

01:01:02.810 --> 01:01:05.820
Trying to use me to read a book

01:01:06.480 --> 01:01:08.280
I'll tell you what

01:01:08.360 --> 01:01:13.410
This book has nothing to do with the feelings of the master

01:01:15.660 --> 01:01:20.210
Hundreds of magicians have read this book, but no one knows it

01:01:20.790 --> 01:01:23.630
Exactly. Nobody knows this is a love letter

01:01:23.710 --> 01:01:25.670
Instead of being cunning,

01:01:25.750 --> 01:01:28.210
start training

01:01:29.010 --> 01:01:32.220
How could no one understand this?

01:01:37.140 --> 01:01:40.480
You can read a book by concentrating your energy

01:01:40.560 --> 01:01:45.150
Think about how else this is possible, knowing that this is a love letter.

01:01:45.980 --> 01:01:49.650
So there must be some other way

01:01:50.690 --> 01:01:52.860
The rest don't know this

01:01:52.950 --> 01:01:55.450
This is known only to those who know about the love letter

01:01:56.030 --> 01:01:57.410
But how?

01:01:57.490 --> 01:02:00.660
How does a love letter begin?

01:02:11.720 --> 01:02:13.130
One more question

01:02:14.090 --> 01:02:15.760
What was your name

01:02:16.760 --> 01:02:18.310
Jinyeowon's first chapter?

01:02:30.610 --> 01:02:32.530
All love letters

01:02:33.990 --> 01:02:35.860
start with the recipient's name

01:02:36.780 --> 01:02:37.910
Her last name

01:02:38.490 --> 01:02:41.660
was Jin, and the name was Seol Ran

01:02:42.660 --> 01:02:45.000
The recipient of the letter was Seol Ran

01:02:45.080 --> 01:02:46.710
"Orchid flower"

01:02:47.880 --> 01:02:49.170
"that is covered in snow"

01:02:50.750 --> 01:02:51.960
Her name

01:02:53.170 --> 01:02:55.050
will open this letter

01:03:33.550 --> 01:03:34.760
I see

01:03:42.930 --> 01:03:44.930
Hey there she is

01:03:46.940 --> 01:03:48.560
Here's Moo Deok

01:04:03.120 --> 01:04:04.660
"You can't curb the flow of water"

01:04:06.160 --> 01:04:07.710
"But every year the earth blooms"

01:04:09.500 --> 01:04:11.540
"We will not take fire into our hands"

01:04:11.630 --> 01:04:13.050
"Let's light a fire with wood"

01:04:15.380 --> 01:04:17.260
"And the wind blows too"

01:04:18.880 --> 01:04:20.340
"a rock or a stone will stop"

01:04:22.050 --> 01:04:25.810
“If you give them free rein, they will disperse to their heart’s content”

01:04:27.600 --> 01:04:29.020
"I see a blue sky"

01:04:30.690 --> 01:04:32.020
"A quiet sigh is heard"

01:04:34.860 --> 01:04:37.030
"I breathe cold and fade away"

01:04:37.610 --> 01:04:39.820
"I turn my sighs into snow and tears"

01:04:40.950 --> 01:04:43.740
“But I can’t shed tears. I hide them as best I can.”

01:04:45.330 --> 01:04:48.080
"I know my eyes will fill with tears again"

01:04:48.790 --> 01:04:53.130
“But I’m a fool, not a single tear rolled down my cheek.”

01:04:58.420 --> 01:05:00.050
Those two are already back

01:05:02.680 --> 01:05:03.890
I don't see Moo Deok

01:05:12.480 --> 01:05:14.560
There are already six people in front of her

01:05:14.650 --> 01:05:16.860
We need to overtake at least two

01:05:27.330 --> 01:05:30.410
“But I’m a fool, not a single tear rolled down my cheek.”

01:05:46.560 --> 01:05:47.640
Where are you going?

01:05:48.680 --> 01:05:49.850
Exactly

01:05:52.310 --> 01:05:53.400
I read

01:06:15.830 --> 01:06:16.840
Number 29,

01:06:16.920 --> 01:06:18.800
Jang Jeong Do, you passed

01:06:19.800 --> 01:06:22.010
One more person left

01:06:55.000 --> 01:06:57.080
I don't want a student who doesn't make progress.

01:06:57.580 --> 01:06:59.670
If you don't do anything, just die

01:07:00.710 --> 01:07:02.710
Hey, this is dangerous!

01:07:02.800 --> 01:07:04.510
You are no longer Nak Soo

01:07:11.180 --> 01:07:13.140
"It doesn't matter how bad you feel,"

01:07:14.230 --> 01:07:16.310
"you have to do what you can"

01:07:18.770 --> 01:07:20.650
If I don't want to do anything,

01:07:22.230 --> 01:07:23.690
I'd rather die

01:07:43.170 --> 01:07:45.050
Room 125, Moo Deok,

01:07:47.470 --> 01:07:48.800
you passed!

01:07:58.020 --> 01:08:00.810
This is word for word "Words of the Heart"

01:08:01.520 --> 01:08:03.440
Chan Wook did it

01:08:05.860 --> 01:08:07.320
Did he manage it?

01:08:12.160 --> 01:08:15.330
- Where is he now?
- In Sejukwon

01:08:15.410 --> 01:08:18.710
His maid fainted during the competition,

01:08:18.790 --> 01:08:20.000
he took her there

01:08:21.170 --> 01:08:22.340
Maid?

01:08:23.000 --> 01:08:24.960
-Are you talking about Moo Deok?
- Yes

01:08:25.050 --> 01:08:27.010
She passed the competition

01:08:27.720 --> 01:08:29.930
She fell at the very end

01:08:30.010 --> 01:08:32.050
but she managed

01:08:32.760 --> 01:08:34.010
Yes?

01:08:38.310 --> 01:08:41.650
My maid risked her life to fulfill my request

01:08:42.360 --> 01:08:43.730
It was my idea

01:08:56.750 --> 01:08:58.080
If you think so,

01:08:59.830 --> 01:09:02.000
she is always there for Chan Wook

01:09:04.040 --> 01:09:05.710
Maid Moo Deok...

01:09:11.550 --> 01:09:15.350
The book I read was a love letter from Master Seo Kyung

01:09:18.140 --> 01:09:19.310
Really?

01:09:20.140 --> 01:09:22.230
Why did he make her invisible?

01:09:22.980 --> 01:09:26.570
His beloved was blind, he wanted her to read her with her heart

01:09:27.940 --> 01:09:29.400
Smart

01:09:29.990 --> 01:09:31.110
I don't think so

01:09:31.950 --> 01:09:33.700
that the letter has reached the addressee

01:09:34.450 --> 01:09:36.530
Then it would be in Jinyowon

01:09:37.290 --> 01:09:38.870
Not in Sosnovy Bor

01:09:39.450 --> 01:09:42.620
An invisible love letter that was never sent?

01:09:44.750 --> 01:09:45.840
How cowardly

01:09:47.800 --> 01:09:50.130
I wrote down my feelings and didn't let her know

01:09:51.630 --> 01:09:53.010
How stupid

01:09:54.340 --> 01:09:55.890
and a pathetic love letter

01:10:01.520 --> 01:10:03.440
You're right. He should have...

01:10:06.520 --> 01:10:08.360
send a letter like you did

01:10:09.820 --> 01:10:12.450
We hire servants in Sosnovy Bor

01:10:13.820 --> 01:10:15.280
This is not a letter

01:10:15.370 --> 01:10:16.740
What is this then?

01:10:16.830 --> 01:10:19.540
If it conveys your feelings, it's a letter

01:10:21.080 --> 01:10:23.580
Wait for me. I'll be there soon

01:10:23.670 --> 01:10:25.420
Don't get caught. Have a nice trip

01:10:34.800 --> 01:10:38.970
I must have looked pathetic in my attempts to get here as a servant.

01:10:39.970 --> 01:10:42.600
You were an incredibly skilled teacher.

01:10:43.100 --> 01:10:44.890
I feel sorry for you

01:10:45.850 --> 01:10:48.360
Have you at least learned to be faithful?
yes fulfill duties

01:10:48.440 --> 01:10:50.480
My teacher tried so hard for me

01:10:50.570 --> 01:10:53.950
I thought I should give it my all

01:10:56.240 --> 01:10:57.950
Did this stress you out?

01:10:58.740 --> 01:11:01.540
Not really. But I doubted

01:11:02.330 --> 01:11:07.080
Answer you as a student or as a master

01:11:07.670 --> 01:11:10.420
Or answer in the style of what you read

01:11:16.260 --> 01:11:17.800
And what did you read?

01:11:18.720 --> 01:11:22.430
Then answer the same?

01:11:24.060 --> 01:11:25.600
Also? What are you talking about?

01:11:26.140 --> 01:11:30.270
It's written right there. "I'll go through anything just to see you"

01:11:30.980 --> 01:11:34.280
“I can do anything, just to have the opportunity to see you”

01:11:34.900 --> 01:11:36.280
And this is my answer

01:11:41.410 --> 01:11:45.870
I should have been prepared before letting him get that close.

01:11:50.000 --> 01:11:51.500
I missed you too

01:11:55.420 --> 01:11:56.760
This is my answer

01:12:05.930 --> 01:12:07.730
What I gave him

01:12:09.270 --> 01:12:13.270
shouldn't have been read or transmitted at all

01:12:15.150 --> 01:12:16.780
It was my stupid and pathetic

01:12:18.570 --> 01:12:20.160
love letter

01:12:21.190 --> 01:12:40.330
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:12:48.620 --> 01:12:51.580
Alchemy

01:12:48.620 --> 01:12:51.560
Shower

01:12:52.000 --> 01:12:53.190
I open my eyes - I already miss you

01:12:53.270 --> 01:12:55.190
- I miss you all day
- That's enough

01:12:55.280 --> 01:12:57.360
There is no escape from this poison

01:12:57.440 --> 01:12:59.400
The antidote is the person who poisoned you

01:12:59.490 --> 01:13:00.860
Are you completely crazy?

01:13:00.950 --> 01:13:02.820
These are the symptoms of my poisoning

01:13:02.910 --> 01:13:06.040
Nak Soo, there is only one person in your thoughts. And this is Chan Wook

01:13:06.120 --> 01:13:08.250
You didn't believe it when I said I was in love with you

01:13:08.330 --> 01:13:10.290
Then make me believe

01:13:10.370 --> 01:13:12.830
This is the most valuable thing I have ever received.

01:13:12.920 --> 01:13:15.840
Do whatever it takes to get him back.

01:13:15.920 --> 01:13:18.720
I had an argument with your maid

01:13:18.800 --> 01:13:21.010
Fight and die, Chan Wook

01:13:21.090 --> 01:13:22.180
I said I missed you

01:13:22.260 --> 01:13:23.680
